0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:50.47,0:01:54.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum..Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.10,0:01:52.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,K-King Wapol! It's Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.27,0:01:53.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah!Dialogue: 50,0:01:55.47,0:01:57.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...Pistol!Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.65,0:02:03.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– King Wapol! – King Wapol!Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.03,0:02:17.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was close...Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.03,0:02:25.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You bastards... How dare you!Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.64,0:02:29.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Again and again...Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.21,0:02:31.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How many times are you gonna stand in our way?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.74,0:02:35.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm? Why are they here?Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.97,0:02:43.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Last time I had to run away since my friend was injured.Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.09,0:02:48.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But this time... there's no need to hold back!Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.90,0:02:51.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You worthless scoundrel!Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.53,0:02:56.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The nerve you have, assaulting Wapol of the Kingdom of Drum!Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.84,0:02:58.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a king, you know! A king!Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.47,0:03:01.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is the supreme ruler of this island.Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.61,0:03:03.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This treatment is deplorable!Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.40,0:03:07.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who cares?! You guys piss me off!Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.04,0:03:10.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid. You know them?Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.08,0:03:12.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I do! He's that annoying big-mouth pirate!Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.85,0:03:13.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big-mouth...?Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.82,0:03:15.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He keeps getting in my way!Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.43,0:03:17.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He munched on my ship, attacked my crew...Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.32,0:03:19.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna stop him right here!Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.16,0:03:22.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,More importantly, aren't you cold in that getup?Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.36,0:03:22.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.89,0:03:24.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See?Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.06,0:03:28.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, did they say he's the king? Isn't he a pirate?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.35,0:03:29.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's your problem?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.90,0:03:33.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! What an idiot! He finally realized his impertinence.Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.84,0:03:36.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our liege, Wapol, is the king of Drum.Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.51,0:03:38.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When you saw him earlier as a pirate,Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.45,0:03:41.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that was nothing more than a temporary arrangement.Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.08,0:03:43.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now he's done being a pirate,Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.45,0:03:46.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and has returned to rule over this great country!Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.50,0:03:48.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's cold up here!Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.22,0:03:49.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what I've been saying!Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.72,0:03:51.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's 50 below, you know!Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.42,0:03:53.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're making light of us!Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.53,0:03:55.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,King Wapol!Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.93,0:04:00.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad... Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.17,0:04:02.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll bite you to pieces!Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.46,0:04:04.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Um, you'll have to wait a bit for that.Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.39,0:04:06.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy went to get some clothes.Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.52,0:04:07.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's gone?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.11,0:04:09.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me ask you a question.Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.74,0:04:13.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Earlier... his arm stretched...Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.25,0:04:16.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep, he's stretchy. He's a rubber man, after all.Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.18,0:04:18.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh... What's that?Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.17,0:04:20.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.74,0:04:24.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,, So, long story short,Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.87,0:04:27.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that rebel of a hag and some Straw Hat pirates are in my castle.Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.83,0:04:29.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once we eliminate them all,Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.58,0:04:34.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there won't be anyone else audacious enough to defy me.Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.57,0:04:36.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Precisely.Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.70,0:04:40.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This will go down as the day the Kingdom of Drum was restored!Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.47,0:04:42.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'll start with you, Dr. Kureha!Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.74,0:04:46.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve moving into my castle during my absence...Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.18,0:04:48.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and even flying a strange flag!Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.65,0:04:52.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I made this castle Hiriluk's grave.Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.85,0:04:59.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I really didn't give a damn about this run-down castle,Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.09,0:05:03.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but this reindeer insisted on flying Hiriluk's flag up there.Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.13,0:05:09.87,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why I raised this skull and crossbones against all diseases!Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.74,0:05:11.92,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,A skull...Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.40,0:05:16.59,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This here... is a symbol of conviction that defies the impossible!Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.28,0:05:21.09,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll save this country as a doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.61,0:05:25.22,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,By raising this flag, I'll fight just like pirates do!Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.82,0:05:31.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In raising this flag... Doctor fought to save this country!Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.11,0:05:40.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you sully my sacred castle with that cretin's flag!Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.01,0:05:43.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Burn down that flag at once!Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.18,0:05:50.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You won't set foot inside this castle...Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.52,0:05:51.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.55,0:05:54.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't let you!Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.69,0:05:57.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,King Wapol... it's...Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.62,0:05:59.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right! From back then...!Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.63,0:06:03.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's that monster...  who followed that stupid doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.97,0:06:08.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That flag... is Doctor's conviction!Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.57,0:06:11.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I won't let you take it down!Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.77,0:06:14.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't let you!Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.91,0:06:18.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Show them no mercy! We're going into the castle!Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.54,0:06:21.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take down every single one of 'em!Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.35,0:06:24.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna fight, too, old lady?Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.32,0:06:25.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Old lady?Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.78,0:06:26.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ugh!Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.58,0:06:29.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If they give you trouble, then I'll lend a hand.Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.41,0:06:30.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Appreciate it...Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.24,0:06:32.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! Leave it to us!Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.36,0:06:34.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These pests are nothing!Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.87,0:06:35.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctorine!Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.92,0:06:41.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, afro man.Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.27,0:06:45.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What kind of "soul brother" throws his afro at a lady?Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.44,0:06:49.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's more like it.Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.84,0:06:52.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fell for it...Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.15,0:06:53.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.56,0:06:56.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah!Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.10,0:06:58.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! Get off me!Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.02,0:06:59.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's this afro?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.82,0:07:00.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Static electricity?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.35,0:07:02.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Exactly!Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.53,0:07:07.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Dammit! Get off! Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.72,0:07:10.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ohhhhh... It's cold! It's cold!Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.46,0:07:11.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Clothes! Clothes!Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.77,0:07:15.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Clothes! Clothes! Clothes!Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.90,0:07:17.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where're the clothes?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.37,0:07:19.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on outside? I hear a commotion...Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.87,0:07:22.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's cold outside! Where're my clothes?Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.51,0:07:25.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not what I asked. What's happening outside?Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.84,0:07:27.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's a fight.Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.55,0:07:29.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see... You guys are okay, right?Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.52,0:07:31.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so stay in bed.Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.06,0:07:33.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can borrow my coat.Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.12,0:07:35.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? But your clothes are ugly!Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.66,0:07:37.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're more stylish than yours.Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.39,0:07:38.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really?Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.23,0:07:40.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, it's alright as long as they're warm.Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.96,0:07:42.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright!Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.76,0:07:46.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh... I wondered what the fuss was about...Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.70,0:07:50.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That bastard! Big mouth's got it coming!Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.07,0:07:51.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.03,0:07:54.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's with this afro?! Get off! Get off!Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.24,0:08:00.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I've got plenty more for ya!Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.15,0:08:02.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Marimo's Static Cling!Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.99,0:08:08.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell?! Damn, they're gross!Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.40,0:08:11.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, reindeer! Don't just watch! Help me!Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.62,0:08:12.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.89,0:08:15.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hurry, get 'em off! Man, this is so gross!Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.56,0:08:17.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't believe it's just plain hair!Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.69,0:08:20.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now they're stuck on me! Take 'em back!Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.50,0:08:23.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Don't give them back to me! Keep one at least!Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.15,0:08:24.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! They're gross!Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.30,0:08:25.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're gross to me, too!Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.74,0:08:27.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Stop it! – Don't give them to me!Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.17,0:08:29.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you guys doing?Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.54,0:08:29.49,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Stop it!Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.49,0:08:33.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmph! They know nothing about teamwork.Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.08,0:08:35.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you one thing, though.Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.22,0:08:37.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Static Marimos look plain but burn with style!Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.25,0:08:41.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ack! Oh, crap! He's gonna burn the afros!Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.58,0:08:42.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here you go!Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.29,0:08:44.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure... Hey! Where're you going?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.56,0:08:45.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The decoy plan!Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.69,0:08:48.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,D-Decoy plan? Am I the decoy?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.63,0:08:49.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Checkmate!Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.33,0:08:53.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ow! Ow! Snow! Snow! Snow!Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.50,0:08:57.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You...!Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.24,0:08:58.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Move!Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.93,0:09:00.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,King Wapol!Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.02,0:09:00.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,, Oh, crap!Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.73,0:09:01.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.88,0:09:06.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah...! Now this is warm!Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.08,0:09:06.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.88,0:09:07.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.25,0:09:08.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Grab my leg from there!Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.85,0:09:10.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your leg? Sure!Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.99,0:09:11.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like this?Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.82,0:09:13.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right! Don't let go!Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.78,0:09:15.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it!Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.26,0:09:16.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Armée de l'Air...Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.79,0:09:21.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gum Shoot!Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.10,0:09:43.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not bad...Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.54,0:09:49.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Th... Thank you. You guys are amazing.Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.91,0:09:53.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Hey, Luffy! You jerk! Isn't that Nami's jacket?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.38,0:09:57.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... Look! The hippo flew away but big mouth's still alive!Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.75,0:09:59.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take it off, you jerk!Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.83,0:10:01.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, are you alright?Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.42,0:10:04.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're stronger than we thought. We underestimated them!Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.28,0:10:07.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They just signed their death warrants!Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.80,0:10:09.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those bastards!Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.73,0:10:10.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.86,0:10:12.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll show them...Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.30,0:10:14.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the true power of the Munch-Munch Fruit!Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.76,0:10:15.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,, Your Majesty!Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.93,0:10:19.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll show them... Munch-Munch Factory!Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.44,0:10:21.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, he stood up!Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.54,0:10:23.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I take it he's not normal?Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.47,0:10:25.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His body must be tough!Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.67,0:10:31.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton is still alive.Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.47,0:10:35.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Issie 20!Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.98,0:10:38.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His body is frozen. That's all.Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.65,0:10:41.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Will you leave him in our care?Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.00,0:10:46.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't those the missing doctors?Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.54,0:10:49.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I heard that there weren't any left in the country.Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.67,0:10:54.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the Issie 20, a group of doctors who work exclusively for Wapol.Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.90,0:10:56.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That makes them bad doctors!Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.72,0:10:58.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right! We can't trust you!Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.80,0:11:02.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So we are supposed to leave Dalton in your careDialogue: 50,0:11:02.60,0:11:04.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,when you sold out to Wapol... to that "king"?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.67,0:11:06.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're you going to do to Dalton?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.38,0:11:10.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you want him to live, then just do as we say!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.95,0:11:15.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We are still doctors.Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.40,0:11:18.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even though we were forced to comply with Wapol and his men,Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.89,0:11:22.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we've always strived to advance our medical knowledgeDialogue: 50,0:11:22.09,0:11:24.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to help the patients of this country!Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.90,0:11:32.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was because a certain quack taught us not to give up.Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.80,0:11:39.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't lose any more... foolish men like him!Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.39,0:11:44.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chess! Call out what I ate today!Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.40,0:11:45.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.69,0:11:51.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well... you ate one butter-sautéed cannon and one raw cannon on the ship.Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.20,0:11:55.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Also cannonball and gunpowder salad and a toasted house from the village.Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.20,0:11:57.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What kind of food is that?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.88,0:11:59.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Talk about omnivorous.Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.38,0:12:01.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just watch...Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.87,0:12:05.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anything I eat becomes my own flesh and blood...Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.46,0:12:09.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's doing something!Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.50,0:12:14.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.67,0:12:15.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that?Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.88,0:12:19.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Munch-Munch Shock!Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.85,0:12:26.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wapol House!Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.06,0:12:27.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A house?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.64,0:12:29.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So cool!Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.73,0:12:33.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on to your surprise! Now this is a kingly technique!Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.94,0:12:36.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Munch-Munch Factory!Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.49,0:12:40.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the...?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.91,0:12:45.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,H-He's eating his own men!Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.20,0:12:46.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's eating them!Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.05,0:13:00.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Feast your eyes on this! Come out, miraculous union!Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.22,0:13:02.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Huh?! – What?! Union?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.69,0:13:13.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am the strongest warrior of Drum...Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.86,0:13:22.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chessmarimo!Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.53,0:13:26.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't that one... just riding on the other's shoulders, though?Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.66,0:13:28.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sweet!Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.50,0:13:29.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's sweet about it?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.62,0:13:32.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down.Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.46,0:13:33.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.75,0:13:39.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If they were that easy to beat, the citizens would've never allowed themDialogue: 50,0:13:39.51,0:13:42.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to stupidly exile the doctors.Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.63,0:13:45.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Constitution of the Kingdom of Drum, Article 1:Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.76,0:13:49.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Those who don't comply with the king's wishes shall die."Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.06,0:13:51.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's this nation's founding principle!Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.19,0:13:56.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which means this country is my country, and that castle is my castle!Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.77,0:14:00.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of all the flags out there, don't you dare fly that quack's!Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.78,0:14:02.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It will ruin my castle!Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.55,0:14:19.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A Jolly Roger...Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.46,0:14:22.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, reindeer. That flag...Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.59,0:14:29.26,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Nothing's impossible when a man raises a skull and crossbones flag!Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.26,0:14:32.52,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what I told you, right, Chopper?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.86,0:14:44.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You bastard... you attacked Doctor's flag!Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.28,0:14:49.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor...Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.62,0:14:51.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even tried to save you!Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.66,0:14:54.71,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper...Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.04,0:14:57.13,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't hold a grudge against humans.Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.71,0:15:01.71,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This country is sick right now. Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.72,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Why, Doctor...?Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.72,0:15:06.26,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,A guy like him isn't worth saving!Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.26,0:15:10.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wha...?Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.43,0:15:12.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.93,0:15:18.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't hit you... if you leave this country!Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.61,0:15:23.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're you saying, Chopper?! You think he'll listen to you?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.11,0:15:26.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... I thought...Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.03,0:15:27.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmph!Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.74,0:15:30.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.33,0:15:37.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, big mouth!Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.58,0:15:38.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.04,0:15:42.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.34,0:15:47.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You weren't even a real pirate, were you?Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.43,0:15:50.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't know what this pirate flag meansDialogue: 50,0:15:50.30,0:15:52.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,because fake pirates risk nothing!Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.18,0:15:54.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those words...Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.15,0:16:03.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp and Mr. Bushido, let's start heading up the mountain.Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.98,0:16:04.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.69,0:16:06.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm done waiting here!Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.15,0:16:09.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm worried that big avalanche might have affected Luffy's group!Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.28,0:16:12.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami has a very high fever!Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.87,0:16:14.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If anything happened...Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.04,0:16:15.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're worried about Nami...Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.00,0:16:20.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,On top of that, you're worried about Dalton and Arabasta, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.84,0:16:25.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi, calm down!Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.34,0:16:27.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're shouldering too many burdens!Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.88,0:16:28.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.97,0:16:34.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami is with Luffy and Sanji. I'm sure she's okay.Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.35,0:16:37.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They'll be fine! I believe in them!Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.69,0:16:41.36,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right... He's right...Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.52,0:16:46.61,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp believes in his friends.Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.61,0:16:49.40,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why he's so calm about this.Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.66,0:16:53.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Usopp. I...Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.12,0:16:56.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're just afraid of going up the mountain, aren't you?Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.20,0:17:01.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,B-But I heard that there're yetis and bear-bunnies out there!Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.17,0:17:03.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then say so from the start!Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.71,0:17:06.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. It's Luffy, so he'll pull through!Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.76,0:17:09.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I'm scared! You got a problem with that?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.42,0:17:10.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton!Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.26,0:17:11.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,W-Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.26,0:17:15.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Dalton!Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.93,0:17:16.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton!Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.97,0:17:19.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seriously, who's this Dalton guy?Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.60,0:17:23.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton! You can't!Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.02,0:17:27.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me through! We can never again allow Wapol to set foot in the castle!Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.57,0:17:30.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not actually heading to the castle, are you?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.11,0:17:32.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In your condition... Don't be crazy!Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.12,0:17:36.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I don't fight now, then when will I?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.03,0:17:41.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If Wapol returns to the throne, this country will be destroyed!Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.33,0:17:45.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In that condition, there won't be a fight!Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.96,0:17:48.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're no match for them, either...Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.38,0:17:53.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will settle this, even if I have to play dirty to win!Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.74,0:18:13.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get on my back. I'll take you to the castle.Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.82,0:18:17.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't worry about it!Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.28,0:18:19.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's not waste your determination.Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.16,0:18:22.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp...Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.33,0:18:25.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on, okay?Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.17,0:18:26.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will ensure...Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.46,0:18:29.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you reach the castle...Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.17,0:18:33.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp...Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.93,0:18:41.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp. I don't think this is going to work...Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.89,0:18:45.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It'll work! I'll take you there!Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.06,0:18:47.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna fight for this country, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.36,0:18:49.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna settle this, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.28,0:18:54.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll definitely take you there!Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.07,0:18:59.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's that moron thinking...Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.12,0:19:04.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We just have to go up the mountain, right?Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.08,0:19:06.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro...Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.67,0:19:13.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You jerk! You jerk! Usopp Punch!Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.84,0:19:13.47,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Ow! Ow! What're you doing?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.80,0:19:17.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And just when I was about to show off my serious power!Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.30,0:19:20.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I know.Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.93,0:19:23.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Serious power!Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.72,0:19:23.39,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa, amazing, amazing...Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.27,0:19:27.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait! If you're set on going to the castle,Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.73,0:19:31.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,there's a ropeway you can use!Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.65,0:19:35.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There can't be. All the ropes to the castle are gone now.Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.41,0:19:38.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's one.Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.03,0:19:40.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Someone has reattached the white ropeDialogue: 50,0:19:40.53,0:19:43.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from a big tree at the edge of Gyasta to the castle!Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.04,0:19:45.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gyasta?Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.46,0:19:48.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the name of the town where Dr. Kureha was last headed.Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.46,0:19:52.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What that flag means, Straw Hat?Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.96,0:19:57.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid pirate flags have no meaning!Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.13,0:19:59.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why you're all hopeless!Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.43,0:20:00.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.80,0:20:05.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A pirate flag isn't something  you raise as a joke!Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.31,0:20:06.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a hippo!Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.69,0:20:10.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only way that I, the king, would've raised one is because it's a joke!Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.15,0:20:13.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When I take down a hipposterous flag, that doesn't mean you put it back up!Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.78,0:20:16.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't break it!Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.19,0:20:19.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The skull and crossbones is a symbol of conviction!Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.49,0:20:23.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dodge it! Watch out!Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.50,0:20:27.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.83,0:20:28.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a direct hit!Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.50,0:20:34.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's how you blow away a hippo!Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.78,0:20:57.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See? It's unbreakable.Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.86,0:21:01.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? But how? He's an idiot!Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.57,0:21:06.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know who the heck this pirate flag belongs to...Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.04,0:21:09.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but this flag is someone's pledge to risk their life.Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.54,0:21:11.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not raised as a joke!Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.92,0:21:21.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't just break a pirate flag and laugh like an idiot about it!Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.72,0:21:28.52,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Incredible...Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.18,0:21:31.06,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,So this is a pirate!Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.14,0:21:32.56,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What are pirates?Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.56,0:21:35.57,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates are remarkable people who roam the seas.Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.57,0:21:40.53,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates are incredible! There are countless people like that out at sea!Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.53,0:21:43.53,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper, go out to sea some day. Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.24,0:21:48.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.29,0:21:48.70,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.58,0:21:53.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat these guys up now. What do you wanna do?Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.96,0:21:54.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.84,0:21:56.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're you saying?Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.09,0:21:58.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You damn hippo!Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.30,0:22:02.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're so determined to defend that flag, then you'll die protecting it!Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.34,0:22:05.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere!Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.05,0:22:06.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.85,0:22:10.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ow!Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.31,0:22:12.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And there goes your backbone.Dialogue: 50,0:22:14.23,0:22:17.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was bound to happen. You're moving around too much!Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.65,0:22:20.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor's Orders!Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.83,0:22:29.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're you hippos doing?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.08,0:22:33.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just stand there and watch! I'll blow him to bits along with that flag!Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.79,0:22:36.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your time's up, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.88,0:22:40.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.46,0:22:42.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the idea!Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.72,0:22:44.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get him, reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.89,0:22:51.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,King Wapol! Watch out!Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.27,0:23:00.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That brat's acting all brave as if he's suddenly become a man.Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.57,0:23:04.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My apologies.Dialogue: 50,0:23:04.95,0:23:07.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't let you lay a finger on the king!Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.25,0:23:17.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There really are some strange creatures in this world.Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.54,0:23:20.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seems like you're that "yeti" that onceDialogue: 50,0:23:20.84,0:23:22.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,got the citizens all riled up.Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.26,0:23:26.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've been an outcast your entire life.Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.93,0:23:28.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You poor monster.Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.72,0:23:32.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why's an outcast trying to save this country?Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.39,0:23:33.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh!Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.68,0:23:35.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.02,0:23:38.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if I don't have friends, I can still fight!Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.36,0:23:42.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As long as Doctor's flag exists, I will...Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.23,0:23:43.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You do have friends!Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.91,0:23:51.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm your friend!Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.96,0:24:05.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.14,0:24:12.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Are you okay?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.31,0:24:14.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm just fine... since I'm rubber.Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.43,0:24:15.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rubber?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.06,0:24:20.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, reindeer. Can you finish off that guy?Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.65,0:24:22.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That jerk? Piece of cake.Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.15,0:24:24.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then it's decided.Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.44,0:24:28.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll take on big mouth!Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.70,0:24:34.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What impudence, Straw Hat, flying around like that!Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.74,0:24:36.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't hesitate this time!Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.79,0:24:39.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna take me down?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.00,0:24:40.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that right, monster?Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.59,0:24:44.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What gives you the right...?Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.88,0:24:48.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me fight... you old ha–Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.22,0:24:49.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and watch.Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.59,0:24:53.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you keep flailing around, you'll never walk on your own again.Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.68,0:24:55.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.06,0:24:58.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When push comes to shove, my reindeer can handle things.Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.77,0:25:05.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My name is Tony Tony Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.15,0:25:07.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a name that the world's greatest doctor gave me!Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.65,0:25:12.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor may have forgiven you for mocking him,Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.91,0:25:15.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I won't show you the same mercy!Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.96,0:25:23.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who'll show no mercy!Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.79,0:25:25.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll stomp you into the ground!Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.63,0:25:29.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rumble Ball!Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.45,0:02:25.38,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,UnbreakableDialogue: 1,0:02:21.45,0:02:25.38,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,UnbreakableDialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000 GigglebotDialogue: 1,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000 GigglebotDialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 1,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,ZenefDialogue: 1,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,ZenefDialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,TypesettingDialogue: 1,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,TypesettingDialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,PhosCityDialogue: 1,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,PhosCityDialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 1,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000 Pepperjack Scolines ZenefDialogue: 1,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000 Pepperjack Scolines ZenefDialogue: 0,0:00:09.73,0:00:11.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,SoundtrackingDialogue: 1,0:00:09.73,0